+2. Update any imports of `agentic_retrieval` or `intelligent_retrieval` to use `rag_router`
+3. Archive then delete: `rag.py`, `agentic_retrieval.py`, `intelligent_retrieval.py`, `agentic_prompts.py`, `search_orchestrator.py`
+
+### Verification:
+- `grep -r "from.*agentic_retrieval\|from.*intelligent_retrieval\|from.*search_orchestrator" app/ --include="*.py"` returns nothing
